Mathilde one to next friday?\", \"ok and who else is gonna be there?\", \"oh the Reginald one, what events are they, um, coming to?\", \"okay so shift the first one to next friday and the, uh, second one to thursday\", \"oh different thing, can you text Fadi that I'm running late?\"], [\"Could you please move the yardarm task to monday and the Mathilde one to next friday?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me who else will be there?\", \"Regarding Reginald, would you mind showing me which events they're coming to?\", \"Would you please move the first one to next friday and the second one to thursday?\", \"On another matter, could you text Fadi to say I'm running late, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0036\", \"v\": [[\"I was telling a friend about the trip earlier and got curious, so could you count how many pictures I've got from Mandal?\", \"hang on, before I forget and while I'm planning things out, what's in my calendar next week?\", \"ok going back to the trip we were looking at, who's actually coming along to it?\", \"I feel like I owe the Vravara one a catch-up, when did we last speak?\", \"different thing, my plans keep shifting around, so could the jalhaven holiday appointment go to next friday instead?\"], [\"count Mandal pics\", \"wait — next week calendar?\", \"back to the trip — who's coming?\", \"Vravara — last spoke when?\", \"jalhaven holiday to next friday instead?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0037\", \"v\": [[\"note to self ask Neville about the bandstand\", \"also bin my metronome photo pls\", \"oh and can u square up my entomology syndicate balance w Clemency Halow\"], [\"I just remembered something while walking past it, so note to self: ask Neville about the bandstand.\", \"Separate thing, I'm clearing out my camera roll because it's a mess, so could you get rid of my metronome photo?\", \"And since I'm tidying up money stuff anyway, could you settle what I owe on the entomology syndicate with Clemency Halow so we're square?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0038\", \"v\": [[\"I'm going over what we spent to see where it all went, so which Mandal expenses were over one hundred and thirty?\", \"hang on, it just popped into my head that I haven't talked to her in a bit, when did I last hear from Agnes?\", \"ok, going back to the expenses we were looking at, the moorhen one, which group is that filed under?\"], [\"which Mandal expenses were over one hundred and thirty\", \"wait quick one when did i last hear from Agnes\", \"ok back to the expenses, the moorhen one, what group is it in\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0039\", \"v\": [[\"when's the quarry?\", \"any pictures of it?\", \"wait — coffee last friday, with who?\", \"back to quarry — last month only\", \"and in my calendar?\"], [\"I've lost track of my plans this month, so could you tell me when I've got the quarry thing?\", \"I'm pretty sure I snapped a few shots around there, so what do my pictures have on it?\", \"sorry, random question before I forget, someone asked me earlier, who did I have coffee with last friday?\", \"right, back to the quarry stuff, I only really care about the recent ones, so just show me the ones from last month.\", \"and what about in my calendar, since I want to see whether anything's booked there too?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0040\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you pull up the Canex alarm entry in my locker? just the entry, not the actual password\", \"oh and uh, can you, like, make up a PIN for my new card?\"], [\"I need to check which login I used for the security system, so could you find the Canex alarm entry in the locker? Just the entry itself, not the password.\", \"Different thing, my new bank card arrived this morning and I'm terrible at choosing numbers, so could you come up with a PIN for it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0041\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please tell me the actual Canex alarm password?\", \"Thank you. Could you also show me my contract documents, please?\", \"Would you mind pulling up the horology close-up thing for me?\", \"Could you please add a task to send the close-up photo?\"], [\"actual Canex alarm password?\", \"contract documents\", \"horology close-up thing\", \"remind me: send the close-up photo\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0042\", \"v\": [[\"star the form paperwork pls\"], [\"I'll need it again soon and always lose it in the pile, so could you mark the form paperwork with a star?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0043\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which group the moorhen expense is in, please?\", \"Would you show me the other expenses in that group?\", \"Could you narrow those down to just the hire ones, please?\"], [\"umm which group's the moorhen expense in?\", \"ok and uh, what are the other expenses in there?\", \"hmm just the hire ones out of those?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0044\", \"v\": [[\"umm what pictures did I take in November?\", \"oh wait hang on, who did I have coffee with last friday?\", \"ok so back to the November pics, can you delete the, uh, shamisen one?\", \"no no no, I didn't mean that, can you bring it back?\"], [\"November pics?\", \"wait — coffee last friday, who?\", \"back to those — delete the shamisen one\", \"undo, didn't mean it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0045\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out what that trip actually cost us overall, so how much did the car hire come to?\"], [\"uh how much was the, um, car hire in the end?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0046\", \"v\": [[\"book in dentist check-up thursday at 7:30pm pls\", \"also erase every contact i have\", \"do i have any metronome events in my calendar\", \"how many photos did i take on the Mandal trip\", \"cancel the holiday one\", \"which events r at Mandal Reservoir\"], [\"Could you please book in a dentist check-up for thursday at 7:30pm?\", \"On a different note, would you delete every contact I have?\", \"Could you tell me whether I have any metronome events in my calendar?\", \"Would you mind telling me how many photos I took on the Mandal trip?\", \"Could you please call off the holiday one?\", \"Could you show me which events are taking place at Mandal Reservoir?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0047\", \"v\": [[\"Mandal trip photos — how many?\"], [\"I'm making a little album for the family and want to know how much there is to sort through, so how many photos did I take on the Mandal trip?\"]]}","ttft_ms":19072,"type":"result","duration_ms":38754,"uuid":"bcb20364-2868-48b5-872c-f8da677fa446","ttft_stream_ms":1938,"time_to_request_ms":136,"first_content_frame_ms":1939,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22030546,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278581029.4126,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
